Cached the profile pointer and field index in locals so the hot path loads each member once, while keeping the same branchless combined validity check. This preserves identical behavior for null profiles, null field tables, and out-of-range indices.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    const auto *p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;

    const Profile::FIELD *fields = p->fields;
    const FIT_UINT8 index = profileIndex;
    if (__builtin_expect((fields == NULL) | (index >= p->numFields), 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;

    return fields[index].num;
}
```